    "body": "No, we can't introduce this for cross-origin iframes, as it leaks information. And so we'd only introduce it for same-origin ones, which would be strange.\r\n\r\nIt sounds like from your original post there are some cross-browser issues, but we shouldn't be adding new APIs to cover up over those.",
